 the truth behind anomalies. One mask always lies\u2014discover which one and use their deception as your guide.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Trust the Liar\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When you identify the absolute liar, question them about the path forward. Their answer reveals the route to avoid\u2014always choose the opposite direction to progress.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025310/extras/dc58c493c9fcab912f4d0cd1e75c90c1.poster.avif?t=1758636392\" width=1000 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025310/extras/dc58c493c9fcab912f4d0cd1e75c90c1.webm?t=1758636392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025310/extras/dc58c493c9fcab912f4d0cd1e75c90c1.mp4?t=1758636392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ABOUT\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Liar Masks&quot;</strong> is a Anomaly horror game featuring st